&lt;p&gt;All new external facing and roofing materials in respect of all the works hereby approved (and any other incidental works carried out in this connection) shall match those of the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance including type, size, colour, bond, pointing, coursing, jointing, profile and texture, Notwithstanding that approved drawings and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;

REASON: To ensure that the external appearance of the building is satisfactory and does not detract from the character and visual amenity of the conservation area.
&lt;/p&gt;
